  tagline: A vast corrupted laboratory where the elements have become creatures with
    opinions about what they will bond with.
  arrivalLines:
  - Chemical Chaos. Don't lick anything.
  - Those element creatures used to be the periodic table. Now they're... the periodic
    TANTRUM.
  restoredLines:
  - Everything's bonding again! Water is WET again!
  - Chemical Chaos is now just... Chemistry. Neat and tidy.
